# Sprint 16: dau vet runtime cua viec tu lam moi nua ket qua tool.
# Khoa la trang thai cua MOT may tai MOT thoi diem; commit no vao repo se
# khien may khac doc duoc mot tien trinh khong ton tai tren may ho.
state/.tool_validation.lock
state/logs/tool_validation_auto.log
.pr_body.md

# Sprint DB-1: ban sao SQLite cua state/*.json.
#
# KHONG commit — va ly do khong phai "tep nhi phan thi phien".
#
# `state/*.json` duoc theo doi trong git va la Source of Truth. Commit ca ban
# sao nghia la mot su that co HAI ban trong lich su, va chung se lech: mot PR
# sua JSON ma quen dung lai .db thi diff van xanh, con nguoi checkout ra doc
# .db se doc mot trang thai khong con ton tai. Mot ban sao dan xuat commit vao
# repo thoi lam ban sao va bat dau lam nguon canh tranh.
#
# Ngoai ra .db la nhi phan: git khong merge duoc, nen moi PR cham vao state se
# thanh mot xung dot phai giai bang tay tren mot tep khong ai doc duoc.
#
# Dung lai bat cu luc nao: `npm run db:mirror` (~1 giay).
# -wal / -shm la trang thai runtime cua MOT tien trinh, khong bao gio commit.
state/sentinelops.db
state/sentinelops.db-wal
state/sentinelops.db-shm
